    "title": "Post-chemotherapy changes in hepatoblastoma",
    "intro": "Most hepatoblastomas are resected after cisplatin-based neoadjuvant chemotherapy. Post-therapy specimens commonly show extensive necrosis, fibrosis, haemosiderin-laden macrophages, calcification and prominent osteoid-like matrix.",
